  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-term review of the CCASFBA-Mali programme - PATRIP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to conduct a mid-term review of the Climate Change Adaptation and Stabilisaton in Fragile Boarder Areas of Mali (CCASFBA-Mali) with the PATRIP Foundation. The review will include a follow up on recommendations from the inception review of the programme (Nov 2021) and to formulate recommendations to improve implementation in the second half of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
